      <text:p text:style-name="P26"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P37">3.24.xx-rev2.<text:span text:style-name="T18">3</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P40">Aprile 2024</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunto par. “<text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo"><text:span text:style-name="T19">G</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo">estione delle Voci Della Sicurezza”</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.2<text:span text:style-name="T20">5</text:span>.xx-rev2.<text:span text:style-name="T20">4</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Marzo 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41"/>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.5</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Agosto 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunte le sezioni &quot;Evidenzia voci in Elenco Prezzi&quot;, &quot;Generazione dello Stato Finale&quot; ed &quot;Esporta selezione in formato Markdown&quot;; aggiornate le sezioni su somme LAVORI/SICUREZZA e Vedi voce; rimossi gli usi ridondanti di &quot;automatico/automaticamente&quot;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Agosto 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Rimosse le icone poste vicino ai nomi dei comandi in tutto il manuale, essendo soggette ad aggiornamenti (mantenute solo le icone &quot;Attenzione&quot; e le immagini illustrative/schermate)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.7</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Agosto 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunta sezione &quot;Riepilogo quantitativo&quot; con la funzione di cancellazione via CTRL; aggiunto paragrafo &quot;% Avanzamento&quot; nella sezione &quot;Inserisci somme LAVORI e SICUREZZA&quot;; aggiornata la sezione &quot;Invia Voce al DP&quot; con la selezione multipla e la rimozione dei collegamenti esterni</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.8</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Agosto 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornata la sezione &quot;Trova voce in Elenco Prezzi/Analisi&quot; con la ricerca Ctrl in Analisi di Prezzo; aggiunta nota su PDF/A-2b nella sezione &quot;Premesse&quot; delle manipolazioni finali; aggiunta sezione &quot;Rinumerazione selettiva delle schede di Analisi di Prezzo&quot;; aggiornata la sezione &quot;Sommari e Quadri di raffronto&quot; con l&apos;opzione &quot;Nascondi scost. 0,00&quot; e la pulizia estesa delle voci; aggiornata la sezione &quot;LA CONTABILITÀ&quot; con l&apos;annullamento automatico delle partite provvisorie sospese</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.9</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Agosto 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunta sottosezione &quot;SAL revisionale&quot; (Modulo TOL) nella sezione &quot;CONTABILITÀ&quot;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.10</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Settembre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunta descrizione opzione &quot;Mostra categorie&quot; nel dialogo Viste (sezione &quot;Suddivisione in Categorie&quot;)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.11</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiunto il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO: L&apos;AGENDA DI CANTIERE SUL TELEFONO&quot; (app per la raccolta dell&apos;agenda di cantiere e importazione nel Giornale Lavori); voce di menu &quot;Importa agenda di cantiere nel Giornale Lavori...&quot;</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.12</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornato il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO&quot; alla versione 0.5.2 dell&apos;applicazione: schermata unica per cantieri e giornate con nuovo elenco giornate, etichette con i due punti, <text:soft-page-break/>pulsante Chiudi, stampa tramite la finestra nativa del dispositivo; aggiunti tre screenshot delle schermate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.13</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">I rimandi alle figure nel testo sono ora riferimenti incrociati che seguono la numerazione delle didascalie; corretto il rimando all&apos;esempio delle SubCategorie, che ora indica la Figura 26</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.14</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornato il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO&quot; alla versione 0.5.3 dell&apos;applicazione: indicazione dell&apos;ultima esportazione di ogni cantiere, proposta di copia di sicurezza prima di eliminare un cantiere con giornate non esportate, foto aggiunte o tolte conteggiate tra le modifiche; screenshot rigenerati</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.15</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornato il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO&quot; alla versione 0.5.4 dell&apos;applicazione: l&apos;esportazione mostra un riquadro con i pulsanti Invia o condividi e Salva sul telefono; l&apos;ultima esportazione è registrata solo a condivisione riuscita o a file salvato; screenshot rigenerati</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.16</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornato il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO&quot; alla versione 0.5.5 dell&apos;applicazione: il file .json viene condiviso come testo (nome che termina con .json.txt) perché il menù di condivisione dei browser rifiuta il formato .json; il file .zip con foto viene salvato direttamente sul telefono; screenshot rigenerati</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.17</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Rigenerato l&apos;indice generale: numeri di pagina allineati al contenuto aggiornato</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.18</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Aggiornato il capitolo &quot;BROGLIACCIO&quot; alla versione 0.7.0 dell&apos;applicazione: &quot;Ripristina da file&quot; accetta anche il file .zip dell&apos;esportazione e ripristina cantiere, giornate e foto, ed è disponibile anche prima di creare il primo cantiere; &quot;Esporta per LeenO&quot; e &quot;Ripristina da file&quot; gestiscono anche tutti i cantieri in un unico file .zip, con scelta dei cantieri da ripristinare; screenshot rigenerati</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.19</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Allineamento al rilascio: corretti i percorsi di menù di importazione ed esportazione (XPWE, GanttProject); descritti i formati di importazione dei prezzari (XML regionali e ZIP, XLS/XLSX, DCF con CTRL), la finestra sulle voci già presenti e il comando Inserisci Riferimento Esterno</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.20</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Brogliaccio 0.7.2: indicazione della protezione della memoria del browser, avviso se mancano giornate rispetto all&apos;ultimo utilizzo, verifica dei dati dopo il ripristino; aggiornato l&apos;indirizzo ufficiale; schermate rigenerate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.21</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Brogliaccio 0.7.4: pulsante Indietro in alto e in fondo alla scheda della giornata, Aggiungi foto a destra, trattino iniziale nelle etichette dei campi, foto visibili nella stampa; schermate rigenerate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.22</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Brogliaccio 0.7.5: promemoria per la dettatura vocale con il microfono della tastiera del telefono nella scheda della giornata e raccomandazione sulla dettatura senza connessione; schermate rigenerate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.23</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Brogliaccio 0.7.6: selezione delle colonne di foto (da 1 a 4) per la stampa e il salvataggio PDF con impaginazione scalabile, numerazione delle pagine («Pagina X di Y»); schermate rigenerate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.24</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Ottobre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Brogliaccio 0.7.8: Invia o condividi funziona anche con il file .zip (condiviso come .zip.txt), avviso privacy con secondo tocco su Conferma e condividi, in caso di condivisione non <text:soft-page-break/>riuscita viene salvato il file con il nome originale, istruzioni per i browser (Firefox) che non condividono file; schermate rigenerate</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.25</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Novembre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Importazione XPWE e DCF: finestra Totali diversi per scegliere tra i prezzi del file e quelli ricalcolati dalle analisi. Certificato di Pagamento: un blocco per ogni SAL, area di stampa dell’ultimo CdP, Rimuovi ultimo SAL rigenera il certificato precedente. Nuovi pulsanti Adeguamento Prezzi (aggiornamento delle voci a un nuovo prezzario) e Ripristina colori nei dialoghi Viste.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.26</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Novembre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Contabilità: SAL finale e Stato Finale (Genera SAL Finale, Elimina Finale, nessun CdP con lo Stato Finale), campi Data misure e Data atti, casella Stampa date, pulsanti Elimina SAL n. ed Elimina tutti, recupero anticipazione nel CdP limitato all’importo in S2, pulsante Ripristina evidenziazioni prezzi nel riquadro Revisione prezzi.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P43">3.26.xx-rev2.27</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P44">Novembre 2026</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P41">Screenshot dei dialoghi Viste sostituiti con le versioni attuali: Elenco Prezzi, COMPUTO/VARIANTE, CONTABILITA (due figure) e Analisi di Prezzo. Descritti i pulsanti Genera base Concordamento (nuova sezione in Elenco Prezzi), Computo senza prezzi, Invia tutto a CONTABILITA e Annulla partite sospese.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table5.D2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="OOoTextBody"/>
   <text:list xml:id="list134543606918135" text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="Numbering_20_1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:h text:style-name="P45" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc12589_579480652"/>PREMESSE<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc12589_579480652"/></text:h>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
