   <text:p text:style-name="P49"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P169"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T291">In ultima analisi, s</text:span>u <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://www.leeno.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T291">www.</text:span>leeno.org</text:a> è presente un archivio di tutte le versioni rilasciate.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P170">Versioni differenti della stessa estensione non possono convivere. <text:span text:style-name="T292">L&apos;installazione di una versione, anche obsoleta, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T164">si sovrappone al</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T292">la precedente installazione. Un doppio click sul file OXT </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T164">produrrà</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T292"> la comparsa di un</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T279">a richiesta di prosecuzione.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P171"><text:span text:style-name="T169">Si consiglia</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> sempre di usare la versione più recente </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T288">di LeenO</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">.</text:span></text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Tabella72" table:style-name="Tabella72">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabella72.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabella72.B"/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Tabella72.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella72.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P172">Tip</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella72.B1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P173">I file rimangono gestibili con i comandi ordinari di Calc. Quindi, <text:span text:style-name="T293">aprire un vecchio lavoro, anche senza LeenO, non è mai un problema.</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Tabella72.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella72.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P174">Attenzione</text:p>
