     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella68.B1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P238">La riga rossa al fondo delle tabelle principali (<text:span text:style-name="T165">Elenco Prezzi</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T165">Analisi di Prezzo</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T165">COMPUTO</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T165">VARIANTE</text:span> e <text:span text:style-name="T165">CONTABILITA</text:span>) serve ad individuare il margine delle stesse. Può essere nascosta o visibile, ma <text:span text:style-name="T165">non va mai cancellata!</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P238">Nel caso di cancellazione accidentale, il comando <text:span text:style-name="T236">LeenO&gt;Uility...&gt;Inserisci riga rossa di chiusura</text:span> la ripristinerà.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:h text:style-name="P182" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="stili e colori"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading__7489_1364689504"/>S<text:bookmark-end text:name="stili e colori"/>tili e colori<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading__7489_1364689504"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P239"><text:span text:style-name="T507">Nei fogli di lavoro, l</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T208">e aree colorate in </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T507">rosa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T208"> indicano </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T508">generalmente </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T208">le celle dove si devono immettere i dati. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T507">Tutte le altre celle sono destinate a ricevere dati solo per via indiretta, se non per casi eccezionali, attraverso </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T507">le formule in esse contenute</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T84">(Figura </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T84"><text:sequence-ref text:reference-format="value" text:ref-name="refFigure0">1</text:sequence-ref></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T84">)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">.</text:span></text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Tabella50" table:style-name="Tabella50">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabella50.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabella50.B"/>
    <table:table-row>
