          </draw:frame>Figura <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure13" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">14</text:sequence>: LeenO&gt;Opzioni...</text:p>
        </draw:text-box>
