     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella57.B1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P334">Evitate sempre di salvare il file in formati diversi da quello di LO Calc. Il formato Excel è sì compatibile, ma <text:span text:style-name="T165">il salvataggio in </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T783">formato diverso da ODS</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T165"> provoca la disattivazione IRREVERSIBILE delle macro contenute nel documento.</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P335">Riservate il salvataggio in formato <text:span text:style-name="T784">diverso da ODS</text:span> solo per output finali verso strutture esterne che non utilizzano <text:span text:style-name="T785">LO</text:span> (controllate che <text:span text:style-name="T785">LO</text:span> non sia impostato per il salvataggio delle tabelle Calc in formato <text:span text:style-name="T571">diverso da ODS</text:span>).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:h text:style-name="P336" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading__14637_1613112675"/><text:span text:style-name="T786">N</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T787">uovo computo</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading__14637_1613112675"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P337"><text:span text:style-name="T788">A</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T514">l primo avvio di Calc dopo l’installazione di LeenO, si potrà avere accesso ad un nuovo file di computo agendo sul </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T789">pulsante home <text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T790">d</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T789">ella toolbar </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T514">o con </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo"><text:span text:style-name="T782">Ctrl+0</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T791">. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T792">N</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T793">el caso in cui stiate già lavorando su di un computo e le toolbar risultino </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T794">non visibili</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T793">, il </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo"><text:span text:style-name="T782">Ctrl+0</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T791"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T795">attiverà</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T793"> la loro visualizzazione.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P331"><text:span text:style-name="T788">Una volta avviato Calc, p</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T796">artendo da </text:span><text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo"><text:span text:style-name="T140">LeenO&gt;Nuovo...&gt;Computo</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T796"> si ottiene un </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T797">file </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T796">che </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T797">contiene diverse tabelle </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T798">comprendenti</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T797"> computo metrico, elenco prezzi, analisi di prezzo e quant&apos;altro utile.</text:span></text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Tabella80" table:style-name="Tabella80">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Tabella80.A"/>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Tabella80.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P189"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr4" draw:name="Cornice13" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="16.806cm" draw:z-index="60">
        <draw:text-box fo:min-height="9.245cm">
         <text:p text:style-name="Figure"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr18" draw:name="Immagine25" text:anchor-type="char" svg:width="16.806cm" svg:height="10.853cm" draw:z-index="93"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
