          </draw:frame>Figura <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure36" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">37</text:sequence><text:s/>- <text:span text:style-name="Ultimus_5f_Testo"><text:span text:style-name="T3">LeenO&gt;Importa/esporta...&gt;Importa/Accoda dati da archivio XPWE</text:span></text:span></text:p>
